Third-party components
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

Akapen depends on and/or bundles third-party components under their own
licenses. Attributions and license texts are collected in
THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES/. Notable planned/known items:

- Rust crates (serde, serde_json, and future image/GPU crates): MIT / Apache-2.0.
- HEIC/HEIF fallback decoder (libheif family, planned): LGPL and related.
  Bundled via dynamic linking / separate bundle so the Apache-2.0 core is not
  encumbered (see docs spec §4.2).
- Bundled ffmpeg CLI (planned, video-frame extraction): LGPL-2.1+ build,
  invoked as a separate process, licensed separately from the Apache-2.0 core
  (see docs spec §4.6).

